+| `correctness` | `test` `mutation-guard` `live-probe` `db-catalog` `static` `ax-dump` `geometry` `capture` `device-walk` `model-eval` | None by type; the claim still needs an observed mechanism. |
+| `visibility` | `live-probe` `db-catalog` `device-walk` | Mocked or bypass-role reads, endpoint 404s, screenshots, and static assertions. |
+| `acceptance` | `live-probe` `db-catalog` `device-walk` | Mocked clients, source inspection, and screenshots. |
+| `persistence` | `live-probe` `db-catalog` | Success screens or a post-walk read with no pre-walk baseline. |
