+| `behaviour` | `model-eval` `device-walk` | Prompt/source text or captures alone. |
+
+### 2b. Typed citations
+
+A typed citation is `<type>:<path>@<sha>`. The type says which instrument observed the claim; an untyped path cannot discharge a claim.
+
