+## 12. Stale-Proof Policy
+
+Evidence is fresh only when tied to the current build or a build less than seven days of commits behind it. Evidence older than 14 days is stale, cannot support readiness, and must be re-collected.
+
+## 13. Surrogate Proof Rule
+
+If a report cites an invalid source from §3, it marks the claim Surrogate Proof, names the missing admissible evidence, and cannot claim UX-RC or higher for that promise.
+
+## 14. LARP Runway
+
+Every formal UX-RC-or-higher run uses a freshly compiled production build with caches cleared. Focused reruns may reuse a fingerprint only for local iteration; they never replace the clean-build evidence required for the readiness state.
